__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
~$*
*.tmp

# build/ IS committed: GitHub Pages serves it and the lab site pulls
# build/publications.json straight from this repo. Do not ignore it.

# Personal details (home address, date of birth, mobile, military service)
# and the documents built from them. Never commit these.
private.yaml
build-private/

# Word and PDF CVs are NOT committed. CI builds them on every push and GitHub
# Pages serves those fresh copies, so a committed copy could only go stale —
# which happened when an agent rebuilt with plain `build.py` (no --docx/--pdf).
# Build locally with `python scripts/build.py --docx --pdf` when you need them.
build/*.docx
build/*.pdf
